open scoped TensorProduct
p2m_open "CategoryTheory CategoryTheory.Limits AlgebraicGeometry NeronModelInfra GoodReductionJacobian ModularCurve~jBar AlgebraicCurve IsLocalRing ModularCurve.IgusaScheme"

set_option maxHeartbeats 6400000 in
